</h2></app-label><p class="text-lg font-bold my-4 text-primary-900 break-words"> Apoios à Inovação e Adoção de IA </p><p class="text-neutral-700 text-xs font-normal max-w-[800px]"> Portugal e a União Europeia disponibilizam diversos instrumentos de financiamento e iniciativas estratégicas para apoiar a investigação, o desenvolvimento e a adoção de soluções de Inteligência Artificial. Estes apoios contribuem para  reforçar  o ecossistema de inovação, acelerar a transição digital e aumentar a competitividade. </p></section><section class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><a class="px-6 before:absolute before:w-full before:h-full before:block before:content[''] before:bg-primary-900 lg:hover:before:opacity-0 before:transition before:duration-300 before:ease before:z-10 group relative text-white flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden text-center rounded-lg h-[182px] md:h-[200px] after:absolute after:w-full after:h-full after:block after:bg-neutral-900 after:left-0 after:top-0 after:opacity-80" href="/pt/inteligencia-artificial/financiamento-nacional"><app-image-asset css="absolute w-full h-full left-0 top-0 transition-400 ease-out object-cover group-hover:scale-zoom"><app-link default="none"><!----><img loading="lazy" class="absolute duration-300 ease-out group-hover:scale-zoom h-full left-0 md:h-full object-cover scale-100 top-0 transition transition-400 w-full" srcset="https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3a82884f-9ec4-4ee0-af26-f62a063c663a?cache=1&amp;width=640&amp;height=427&amp;mode=CropUpsize 640w, https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3a82884f-9ec4-4ee0-af26-f62a063c663a?cache=1&amp;width=1366&amp;height=911&amp;mode=CropUpsize" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 640px, 1366px" src="https://bo.digital.gov.pt/api/assets/etic/3a82884f-9ec4-4ee0-af26-f62a063c663a?cache=1&amp;width=1366&amp;height=911&amp;mode=CropUpsize" alt=""><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-link></app-image-asset><!----><h3 class="text-lg